{"2651830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vlad Voievod Dracula: Dungeons of Edirne", "steam_appid": 2651830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in the Ottoman Court in Edirne, Vlad Tepes Dracula travels to slave markets, dungeons and prisons, recruiting skilled warriors to help him take the Wallachian throne. This is when he hears about a great warrior kept in the dungeons of Edirne. A Persian from an old tribe of warriors called Hashashin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/extras/8e202247e8ef80030c8b1985cb0741f0.avif?t=1764608347\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautyful pixel art game with five carefully hand crafted levels with five cool bosses, well placed enemies, weapons and ammo designed to bring back that interesting old-school challenge. In Classicvania style you hit torches to receive sub-weapons and collect hearts (ammo) to power them. Hit false walls to find the famous &quot;wall-meat&quot; that refills your energy, and get powerful sword upgrades hidden in the dungeon walls. Find secrets and discover the most valuable treasures by crouching in key locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed NES games like Castlevania I/III, Ninja Gaiden III, Batman the video game, Shatterhand, Journey to Sillius - this game might be perfect for you. Give it a try!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game by Tiberius</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in the Ottoman Court in Edirne, Vlad Tepes Dracula travels to slave markets, dungeons and prisons, recruiting skilled warriors to help him take the Wallachian throne. This is when he hears about a great warrior kept in the dungeons of Edirne. A Persian from an old tribe of warriors called Hashashin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/extras/8e202247e8ef80030c8b1985cb0741f0.avif?t=1764608347\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautyful pixel art game with five carefully hand crafted levels with five cool bosses, well placed enemies, weapons and ammo designed to bring back that interesting old-school challenge. In Classicvania style you hit torches to receive sub-weapons and collect hearts (ammo) to power them. Hit false walls to find the famous &quot;wall-meat&quot; that refills your energy, and get powerful sword upgrades hidden in the dungeon walls. Find secrets and discover the most valuable treasures by crouching in key locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed NES games like Castlevania I/III, Ninja Gaiden III, Batman the video game, Shatterhand, Journey to Sillius - this game might be perfect for you. Give it a try!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game by Tiberius</h2>", "short_description": "A Classicvania action-horror game where you play as Vlad Tepes Dracula, the medieval Voievod (Warlord) of Wallachia. Fight your way through the Dungeons of Edirne Castele to recruit a great warrior sentenced to death at the hands of a man eating Inquisitor.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/70b23db8483f054a6511d00f0e0bfddad3fdf7be/header.jpg?t=1764608347", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/996da51947ed5fb675a7f3d52788f55cdab3a9d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764608347", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651830/996da51947ed5fb675a7f3d52788f55cdab3a9d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764608347", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Req